OL,3,GNEWSA'Nuisance' illegal e-bikes seized
OL,4,Ain town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have seized nine illegal e-bikes
OL,7,Fand three e-scooters in a crackdown on
OL,8,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,10,FAnti-social riders were pursued by
OL,11,Fofficers, who issued 10 traffic
OL,12,Ftickets, in the bid  to "help make
OL,13,FLeamington a safer place", Warwickshire
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FThe operation comes after concerns from
OL,17,Fresidents about "nuisance motorcycles,
OL,18,Fe-bikes, and scooters", as well as "the
OL,19,Fway some delivery riders use roads and
OL,20,Fpublic spaces".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
